<DocLayout title="" description="the build graph, in your editor">
  <header>
    <h1>bazel-language-server</h1>
    <code>//...</code>
  </header>

  <p>
    Language server for Bazel build files. Symbols, diagnostics, navigation and
    rename across <code>BUILD</code>, <code>*.bzl</code>, <code
      >MODULE.bazel</code
    >, <code>WORKSPACE</code> and <code>*.scl</code>.
  </p>

  <p>
    Bazel itself is optional. The target index is parsed from BUILD files, so
    the server answers without a Bazel process and without a build.
  </p>

